# What `vercel deploy` uploads from this checkout. With this file present the CLI no longer reads
# .gitignore, so everything is listed here: only the app, the shared packages and the lockfile go up.
# apps/web/public/data (the pre-built Advisor catalog and grade files, gitignored) is uploaded on purpose.
/*
!/apps
!/packages
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.cache
**/.ui-check
**/.vercel
**/.env*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/public/vendor
